=head1 DESCRIPTION

The status of an outbound cross-cluster connection.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 Message => Str

Verbose information for the outbound connection.


=head2 StatusCode => Str

The status code for the outbound connection. Can be one of the
following:

=over

=item *

B<VALIDATING> - The outbound connection request is being validated.

=item *

B<VALIDATION_FAILED> - Validation failed for the connection request.

=item *

B<PENDING_ACCEPTANCE>: Outbound connection request is validated and is
not yet accepted by the remote domain owner.

=item *

B<APPROVED> - Outbound connection has been approved by the remote
domain owner for getting provisioned.

=item *

B<PROVISIONING> - Outbound connection request is in process.

=item *

B<ACTIVE> - Outbound connection is active and ready to use.

=item *

B<REJECTING> - Outbound connection rejection by remote domain owner is
in progress.

=item *

B<REJECTED> - Outbound connection request is rejected by remote domain
owner.

=item *

B<DELETING> - Outbound connection deletion is in progress.

=item *

B<DELETED> - Outbound connection is deleted and can no longer be used.

=back




